{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>經常請客、願意替別人花錢，真的能讓財運變好？台灣命理專家王老師近日在Instagram發布影片，分享一項關於金錢與幸福感的研究，指出將錢花在別人身上，不見得是吃虧，反而可能讓人獲得更多快樂，並建立富足的心理狀態。</p><p>王老師在影片中提到，一項研究曾將參與者分成兩組，一組將金錢用於自身消費，另一組則用來替別人購買東西，結果發現，將錢花在他人身上的受試者，當天感受到的幸福感更高。他認為，付出不一定需要花費大筆金錢，像是請朋友喝飲料、隨手捐出零錢等小舉動，都可能帶來正向情緒，讓人從分享的過程中獲得滿足感。</p><p>命理師揭秘「喜歡付出」的人為何容易成功：</p><figure><img alt=\"（Instagram@96iching）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261026/1191447045244719104175039.jpeg/QLswVNv__rFg3H1-g9a5FPMwG3M2bnbKFS1S8hUtUvI\"/><figcaption>（Instagram@96iching）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（Instagram@96iching）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261026/1191447047451054080372149.jpeg/2WWfocDe9OrjROIHmr9TR89GkQxycKgkCTfNqgk3zao\"/><figcaption>（Instagram@96iching）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（Instagram@96iching）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261026/1191447049611251712236019.jpeg/Jdp4NYmOgY4wm6P7S9Q4ttBwWUJDBT4xueCglLngoJQ\"/><figcaption>（Instagram@96iching）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（Instagram@96iching）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261026/1191447051737894912674281.jpeg/tEi2bMrA0hN8c9iu_8z9VL5LAHGFmYk946SoWOOkqFg\"/><figcaption>（Instagram@96iching）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（Instagram@96iching）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261026/1191447056980905984753904.jpeg/1MNBe1a62Z9CCqqQaLCjVCV5H_fwMXNej290AY9vdAE\"/><figcaption>（Instagram@96iching）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（Instagram@96iching）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261026/1191447070477651968039746.jpeg/LHUklhStXFPAyZvj2pdzFMmy6e-46X7Q8LfZuvC32bo\"/><figcaption>（Instagram@96iching）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（Instagram@96iching）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261026/1191447072675598336169054.jpeg/95pZKXw4KYMu3caYag0rqQUT8gqWKsH1d9AWmnfQFpo\"/><figcaption>（Instagram@96iching）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（Instagram@96iching）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261026/1191447074814824448042793.jpeg/V7tqDfV5r2Evd7-AGpyFcMSscna8w4YPoIU4QqCFOEI\"/><figcaption>（Instagram@96iching）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（Instagram@96iching）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261026/1191447076735946752591378.jpeg/AByONm0ljTZqwmYFDcZc3c8NMztP8CKgxqCWg8agloM\"/><figcaption>（Instagram@96iching）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（Instagram@96iching）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261026/1191447078980030464461289.jpeg/Mcmu8PeMCTTzRnWLbmfGmDx-4tA9C8EZ8e7rtPHu67Q\"/><figcaption>（Instagram@96iching）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（Instagram@96iching）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261026/1191447072906153984890317.jpeg/uyV9FRD5pW0xSqy5OnjEg8TDzWUc4nCpOdcNZznXDWc\"/><figcaption>（Instagram@96iching）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（Instagram@96iching）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261026/1191447075078934528549387.jpeg/MlM7SwwF_tTxHPFFNRKatGus7hembzybjyjRUI8o0VA\"/><figcaption>（Instagram@96iching）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（Instagram@96iching）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261026/1191447077192994816268930.jpeg/JVzaKMQJ-1Ol_9d_Ta7Lp4f59E34ovapauZRs2rmUbM\"/><figcaption>（Instagram@96iching）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（Instagram@96iching）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261026/1191447079277694976419367.jpeg/R1-_ZzDc_hHgsX_KkPDg193ZOlkkOAB0mJaX-5iWl_s\"/><figcaption>（Instagram@96iching）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（Instagram@96iching）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261026/1191447081223983104932560.jpeg/rE78wTw-LrEhiJk1SZ54lGPJgE6aLId6MW9tvjFvbb4\"/><figcaption>（Instagram@96iching）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（Instagram@96iching）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261026/1191447009005932544805471.jpeg/5rmcSonxevsZRF9ANCvO7xMG8KKUZcxl2wkAT9sJAE8\"/><figcaption>（Instagram@96iching）</figcaption></figure><p>除了心理層面的影響，王老師也從命理角度提出看法，一個人如何看待金錢，可能影響自身的行為與人際互動。若總是擔心金錢不夠用，容易陷入匱乏的思維；相較之下，願意在能力範圍內分享資源的人，可能更容易展現從容與自信，進而建立良好的人際關係。他認為，這種「不缺乏」的心態，有機會為自己創造更多貴人緣及發展機會。</p><p>影片曝光後，部分網友對王老師的說法表示認同，有人留言「好準喔」，也有人留下愛心表達支持。另有網友將影片分享給親友，提醒身邊的人「要記得喔」，顯示樂於付出、分享金錢可能帶來正向感受的觀點，獲得部分觀眾認同。</p><p>不過，另一派則提出不同經驗，其中一名網友直言「我不相信，我之前也是常請客、常借朋友們錢，但從我拒絕無效的社交之後，資產增加的速度才開始加快」，相關留言獲得不少認同。也有人表示「準不準我不知道，至少在我身上不準」，質疑經常替別人付錢是否真的能增加財富，認為若沒有妥善控制支出，反而可能影響存款累積。</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀】運氣好的人通常都有這5種特質（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250722/1024295147799580672194286.jpeg/20wFOkUIP1vEUR0hemGi6JVTPjjh-3gD_qTnY_6k52M\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀】運氣好的人通常都有這5種特質（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"運氣好的人通常都有這5種特質（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240521/869605100027514880805647.png/6WLYVCpsAAAWIG5RRmaXN6_A8sQjTpN1u8o_LbvKPy0\"/><figcaption>運氣好的人通常都有這5種特質（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"運氣好的人通常都有這5種特質（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240521/869605103034961920371695.png/C2GKsyyUdhm_w9ASfi9xBje9qgafxMPnd-c0CnfnNAo\"/><figcaption>運氣好的人通常都有這5種特質（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"運氣好的人通常都有這5種特質（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240521/869605105178382336389250.png/_Xsorn9iJz7OxtflOgka-gcbiBoED706seGFYLHhhWA\"/><figcaption>運氣好的人通常都有這5種特質（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"運氣好的人通常都有這5種特質（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240521/869605107325997056543870.png/tF50_dU1VQqFiz7TmBjN82nJO4D0mv-xQvf8VEL3_FQ\"/><figcaption>運氣好的人通常都有這5種特質（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"運氣好的人通常都有這5種特質（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240521/869605097645019136342815.png/-mGXl5LJMUhWwsD1Z1L-xdTg83sLWakYFO5CkBTuQpA\"/><figcaption>運氣好的人通常都有這5種特質（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"運氣好的人通常都有這5種特質（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240521/869605099817799680317465.png/baHjuUuygRD8TiYQ3UAXn86-WW_N0n5J-uK_Ufriv1E\"/><figcaption>運氣好的人通常都有這5種特質（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"運氣好的人通常都有這5種特質（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240521/869605102145769472541073.png/y690XeDGlh-DLOiejOtC__u8gBivl_v8l0noiZdJ6Ik\"/><figcaption>運氣好的人通常都有這5種特質（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"運氣好的人通常都有這5種特質（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240521/869605104561819648934527.png/OwxcdbzoL0pFvrUsurCfROgQ7L-2s49wbHYkS2x2JEs\"/><figcaption>運氣好的人通常都有這5種特質（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"運氣好的人通常都有這5種特質（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240521/869605106575216640147830.png/ijZ46dPmAwKeXZwSCvuUzZq3LwGbUTUwp6_s-aev7Pk\"/><figcaption>運氣好的人通常都有這5種特質（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"運氣好的人通常都有這5種特質（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240521/869605096525139968031642.png/qM-UKi5wZCUDUqaq_zsaM-ws2LeXQ67QR2cKUkdnClI\"/><figcaption>運氣好的人通常都有這5種特質（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"運氣好的人通常都有這5種特質（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240521/869605099033464832032159.png/GNlTvOi9yXjE8axhFKuRPv1P2Q1tDos4f9U1XX_VNV0\"/><figcaption>運氣好的人通常都有這5種特質（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"運氣好的人通常都有這5種特質（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240521/869605101340463104834527.png/s_T1OAKS1URT3ukHOyXblStBrPlKXKOahy_FF4cvxRc\"/><figcaption>運氣好的人通常都有這5種特質（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"運氣好的人通常都有這5種特質（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240521/869605103458717696025649.png/JxOtwI4xN-NQzpLGsEzmuGQJfETFhATFzl_lWc5f5Vk\"/><figcaption>運氣好的人通常都有這5種特質（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"運氣好的人通常都有這5種特質（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240521/869605106180952064208359.png/NHxM9mJa8a9hcgU0c4itMEI6GPEzIGVqQx09RkMdPUY\"/><figcaption>運氣好的人通常都有這5種特質（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"運氣好的人通常都有這5種特質（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240521/869605094872584192092486.png/xgxejvXo5yHn00ik9kRLm8n4AF2iUqtDpQoz26UKM9s\"/><figcaption>運氣好的人通常都有這5種特質（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>此外，也有網友從家庭開銷的角度提出疑問，有人好奇：</p><p>「老師，但錢都花在家人身上，這算不算一種八字的劫財」</p><p>「我花在老婆跟女兒身上，我的錢呢」</p><p>反映出不少人對家庭支出與財富累積之間的疑惑。</p><p>天生自帶強運！「4星座」命好旺到擋不住 靠實力讓日子越過越富足</p><p>天降橫財！12星座「有望一夕暴富」排行 冠軍不愛慢慢存錢</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p><p>本文內容反映原文作者的意見，並不代表《香港01》的立場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T11:42:43.579476+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1553,"images":32,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T11:30:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T14:40:42.342859+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T11:38:37.699010+00:00","content_hash":"9f75972268aa21b004feed27df72418f5d0ee83acfd76c0ca269053a9dabeb25","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}